  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"410\" data-original-width=\"449\" height=\"183\" src=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔸 מְדִינִיּוּת דֵּמוֹנִית בְּמִדְיָן<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔸&nbsp;מִלַּנְכוֹלְיָה&nbsp;נַכְלוּלִית כּוֹלֶלֶת<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔸 פְּאֵר כֶּעָפָר בִּפְעוֹר</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">📜</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</span><span data-end=\"141\" data-start=\"127\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">פירוש קצר:</span></p><p data-end=\"443\" data-start=\"143\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">1️⃣ מדיניות פיתוי והשחתה בעצת בלעם.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">2️⃣ אווירת עצב וכבדות עקב עוון הפתיינות.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">3️⃣ פאר ישראל ירד לעפר בחטא בַעַל פְּעוֹר.</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהַכֹּל מִתְפָּאֲרִים,</span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br /></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span data-end=\"108\" data-start=\"80\" style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">היופי האמתי הוא זה שנשאר - גם כשהיופי החיצוני נעלם</span>.</span></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; fon